1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,240
If you water a fern, where does it all go?

2
00:00:03,700 --> 00:00:05,638
The top soil soaks it up first.

3
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:08,220
But only the roots can drink it.

4
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:11,340
So the extra sinks through the gravel

5
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:13,700
and drains into the saucer.

6
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:15,964
Sprigly.

7
00:00:15,964 --> 00:00:17,566
One capful per litre.
